Subject: [PATCH 1/3] data(storage-as-awards): intake CAISO Daily Energy
 Storage Report battery AS awards 2023-2025

Schema-first intake of the measured CAISO battery/hybrid AS-award series
(RU/RD/SR/NR, IFM hourly + RTPD 15-min averaged) from the quarterly
storage-report xlsx, per-ISO registry module (no iso ladders), local-year
partitions, DST clock-label handling (spring skips HE3, fall runs 1..25).
DA battery means 1,010/1,484/1,652 MW (2023/24/25) reproduce the
DMM-published 1,040/1,500 MW anchors to ~1%. Raw xlsx committed by the
apply workflow (binary transport).

